## Why teams use tseda

`tseda` is built for analysts and technical teams who want to move from operational data to reliable analytical judgment without losing transparency. It is a practical bridge between exploratory signal analysis and model-ready decomposition, especially in settings where the series is not just a dataset, but part of a real operational process that needs to be understood and monitored over time.
